+SCOP
+----
+Acest checkpoint fixeaza punctul de plecare reconstructibil pentru integrarea
+CP4.1 V2 in agentul unic ZomDroid. Ramura logica de lucru este:
+
+  ZomDroid-R11-CHUNK-OPTIMIZATION-SOURCE
+
+R10 JAssimp Direct ramane baza si nu este inlocuit, eliminat sau separat intr-un
+al doilea agent.
+
+IDENTITATE INPUTURI
+-------------------
+Sursa R10:
+  fisier: ZomDroid-R10-JASSIMP-DIRECT-SOURCE-2026-08-29.tar.zst
+  sha256: 2e3e8d8724a9c88f505252eb5a5fe0271da3fe886defe1d4fc367d720c586bbb
+
+Pachet referinta CP4.1 V2:
+  fisier: MGLPZ-ChunkProfiler-CP4.1-V2-PACK(1).zip
+  sha256: b25a5a74983c6854b18507c03aa00fea144b8830225ee5aba9ec003872e3347e
+
+Project Zomboid Build 42.20:
+  fisier primit: projectzomboid(7).jar
+  sha256: e4661ca9cb168abc995d3cf59994fa17f66ba8a4e2c2899cbfa48f7eacea54b8
